{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595340/extras/spacer.png?t=1634729772\" /><br><br>Absolute fan or simple puzzle enthusiast? Sweet Home Puzzle will satisfy you!<br><br>Enjoy 9 difficulty levels from easy to very difficult, to suit your level of play without falling into monotony thanks to the many variations of parts.<br><br>Choose your puzzle from more than 100 images, set your own shortcuts, choose your music and play relaxed like at home.<br><br>For the curious, each puzzle, from natural landscapes to works of art, comes with a description, so your puzzles will hold no secrets for you.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595340/extras/spacer.png?t=1634729772\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features :</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Already 100 unique images<br></li><li>9 difficulty levels for each puzzle: from 24 to 1600 parts<br></li><li>Many variations of pieces by level of difficulty that will allow you to vary the pleasures<br></li><li>Drag&amp;Drop and \u00ab double click \u00bb (click to select, move, click to drop) to move your parts<br></li><li>Automatic backup and Steam Cloud: don't lose any of your progress and find your backups on all your computers<br></li><li>Up to 15 sorting screens allowing you to form groups of parts by colors or shapes<br></li><li>Customizable background color<br></li><li>Choose your relaxing soundtrack: jazz piano or handpan</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595340/extras/spacer.png?t=1634729772\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And more :</h2><br>Content listed below is not in game yet, but already planned.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u00ab Puzzle of the week \u00bb : one new puzzle each week !<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>MacOS and Linux support</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.